# AI Employee Vault - Git Ignore

## Credentials & Secrets (NEVER commit these)
credentials/
.env
*.pem
*.key

## Session Data
credentials/whatsapp_session/
credentials/linkedin_session/
credentials/gmail_token.json

## Logs
logs/*.log
logs/audit/*.jsonl
logs/errors/*.json
logs/whatsapp_debug/

## Processing & Temporary Files
Processing/*.json
Processing/*.tmp
*.pyc
__pycache__/
*.pyc

## Test Files
TEST_*.md
test_*.txt
debug_*.md

## OS Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

## IDE Files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

## Optional: Large data files
Accounting/Transactions_*.md
Briefings/archive/

## Keep these folders but ignore contents
Inbox/*
!Inbox/.gitkeep
Needs_Action/*
!Needs_Action/.gitkeep
Done/*
!Done/.gitkeep
